  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Stoke Tracks high-performance ski pole baskets leave behind animal tracks, not microplastics. These baskets are fully biodegradable allowing adventurers to carve trails without concern for their environmental footprint. The collection consists of:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Fox Paw - Hot Pink, Dawn Yellow,&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Bear Paw - Deek Blue, Dawn Yellow</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Wolf Paw - Aubergine, Deep Blue, Himalayan Blue, Forest Green</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Mountain Lion Paw - Hot Pink, Aubergine, Himalayan Blue, Forest Green&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Brand Background:&nbsp;</strong>\"Get outside!\" is a rallying cry. A family motto. A way we live. Stoke Tracks was born from a passion for the outdoors and a desire to protect it. Founded by Derek Brown and Vanessa Whitley, Stoke Tracks was inspired by a skiing adventure in Idaho with their five boys. Now the company is shaking up the outdoor gear world with fully biodegradable ski pole baskets that turn heads. Stoke Tracks is built for those who ride hard, play wild, and give a damn about the planet and mountains we ride. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Unique Selling Point: </strong>Who says you can't have fun and turn heads while crushing it on the slopes? Stoke Tracks is all about high-performance, style, and standing out from the crowd. These are not your standard, boring old ski pole baskets. They are wild and make a statement. Not only are these ski pole baskets fully biodegradable (as in NO MICROPLASTIC), $1 from the sale of every product supports Protect Our Winters.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Payment Terms: </strong>Receive commission on every sale you drive! We've got a 30-day cookie window, and fast payouts via PayPal and Venmo. Rack up the cash while building stoke!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Other:</strong> Ready to break away from the pack? Join Stoke Tracks affiliate program and help fuel the adventure. Represent a brand that's all about fun, freedom, and making every ride unforgettable. Start earning while sharing a product that stands for sustainability and STOKE.&nbsp;</p>",
